# AO Chats Backend — Environment Templates
#
# Development: copy .env.development.example → .env.development
# Production:  set variables in Render (see .env.production.example)
#
# The server loads `.env.${NODE_ENV}` automatically:
#   npm run dev        → .env.development (NODE_ENV defaults to development)
#   Render deploy       → .env.production values in Render Dashboard
#
# Validate locally:
#   npm run validate-env
#   npm run validate-env:prod
